{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #137deb;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">引 言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">中秋国庆佳节将至，消费者服饰需求不断增加，各地商家每日订单量不断提升，物流压力也随之而来。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为此，京东物流升级商圈揽收专人保障服务，<span style=\"color: #137deb;\">在421个核心商圈中设置专人专揽，同时针对客户的特殊打包需求等增值服务进行体验提升，具有最快一小时上门、专属小哥、专业打包、价格实惠的特点</span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流将持续优化商圈揽收专人保障服务，为更多服饰商家和消费者打造更加良好的物流揽收环境，不断提供更加舒适的物流服务体验。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1695727742170.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1695727764098.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01530", "contentTitle": "商圈揽收专人保障服务体验提升", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1695723372000, "id": 3641, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1695727780380.png", "updateTime": 1702867407000}}